# Step 4 part 1: six forms in every rock, facing north in the creative inventory; the rod from an Unaligned crystal of either Evolution.
Machines: 114 machine block\(s\) facing north; 2 Unaligned crystal kind\(s\) make the Crystal Rod$
# Carving: seven strikes go round the six forms and back to Free stone; only the front carves. The
# struck face keeps the glyph, so the Motor's hub, its {side}, is the face opposite (west).
Machines test: strikes carve gather-east, refine-east, focus-east, scatter-east, amplify-east, motor-west, free; another face does nothing: yes; the Gather block holds 1 crystal\(s\) on its front$
Machines test: the rod turned the front up with 1 crystal\(s\); a sneaking tap switches it Dormant: yes$
Machines test: the Crystal Rod made: yes, the crystal used up: yes, rock left 1$
# Focus: each Elemental does its evocation's work for a tenth of a cast; Earth rises once and goes Dormant.
Machines test: a Fire Focus Acted, paid 1\.0, the firepit burns: yes; an Ice Focus Acted, the farmland under the flax soaked: yes$
Machines test: an Earth Focus Acted, 4 of 4 columns rose 2 to the north and east, Dormant: yes, then Idle$
# Amplify: a Glowing Sky Focus lifted to Luminous's power reaps ripe crops into a chest and replants them.
Machines test: a Glowing Sky Focus amplified to 2 Acted; 9 of 9 ripe flax replanted, some item\(s\) in the chest$
# Scatter: a Glittering crystal does nothing; Glowing Earth tills and Glowing Ice waters the 9×9.
Machines test: a Scatter with a Glittering crystal Idle; Glowing Earth Acted, 81 of 81 tilled; Glowing Ice Acted, 81 of 81 soaked$
# Sockets: a capacitor adds its capacity and charge and leaves full; a Dormant block cuts a line in two.
Machines test: a capacitor raised the capacity from 150 to 250 and brought 100; taken out full it holds 100; a Dormant block splits the line into 1 and 1; the refining is 0\.50 done$
Machines test: a Refine block refined 3 crystal\(s\) in 1 day\(s\), 4 of 4 are Fire$
# The Crystal Motor joins the quern's network on its hub, below, and turns it; its sockets face up.
Machines test: a Crystal Motor on a quern, powered: yes, torque 0\.25, on the quern's network: yes, sockets facing up$
# A Motor has no store of its own: its aligned crystals are capacitors (note rev 102).
Machines test: a cut-off Motor stores 10 in 100 with one Glittering crystal, runs an hour: yes, stops when spent: yes; an Unaligned one stores 0 and turns: no$
Machines test: the quern turns: yes$
# The first secret: an Unaligned Focus quickens a growing seedling.
Machines test: an Unaligned Focus over a growing seedling Acted, quickened: yes$
# Switching its only crystal Dormant stops it, and the quern does not coast on.
Machines test: with its only crystal Dormant the Motor is unpowered: yes, and the quern has stopped: yes
# Step 4 part 2, Products and logistics. A Dead Socket turns a Motor from its line, and stops at once when the line is cut.
Machines test: a Dead Socket fitted in a Motor: yes, refused by a Focus: yes; powered: yes, torque 0\.25$
Machines test: the Dead Socket's quern turns: yes$
Machines test: the moment its line is cut, the Dead Socket's Motor is unpowered: yes$
Machines test: cut off, the Dead Socket's Motor is unpowered: yes, and the quern has stopped: yes$
# The shelf: the first item with work goes first; a product the shelf uses goes back to the input, else to the output.
Machines test: a shelf of seeds then an axe Acted, 9 of 9 sown, logs left 2; then Acted, firewood in the output 8; with firewood on the shelf Acted, firewood in the input 4$
# A sapling, the shovel digging charcoal, and a full output sending the machine Dormant without working.
Machines test: a shelf sapling Acted: sapling-oak-free; a shovel Acted, 9 of 9 piles dug, charcoal in the output: yes; with the output full Full, the piles kept: yes, Dormant: yes, stopped full: yes$
# The play-test's gate: one Glowing Unaligned Focus with an Amplify and a shelf of axe, shovel, firewood and
# firestarter turns a chest of logs into a roofed charcoal pit, keeping the front cell for the firepit, and lights it.
Machines test: the roofed pit after [0-9]+ working\(s\) \(Acted [0-9]+\): 5 of 5 cells full piles, the front cell holds charcoalpit, lit: yes, nothing in the output: yes$
# Felling pays by the logs: a Glittering crystal fells one log a working.
Machines test: a Sky Focus at a tree of 5 logs Acted, paid 5 working\(s\), 0 log\(s\) standing, 5 log\(s\) in the chest$
# Memory: two crystals in Awakened stone, cycled through the Focus one a turn.
Machines test: a Memory took 2 crystals: yes, a third: no; its Focus worked fire, ice, sky, fire; the magazine holds sky, fire$
# The plate claims salt from salt water boiled above it, the chance set to 1.
Machines test: a Fire Focus over a plate Acted, salt water left 0 of 9, salt in the plate's chest 1$
# An Earth Focus facing sideways bores a 2×2 into its chest and goes Dormant.
Machines test: an Earth Focus facing east Acted, a 2×2 bored 2 deep, 8 block\(s\) in the chest, Dormant: yes$
